  "details": "Why would you want a toggle that simply makes the end key not do anything?\n\nI don't like the AFK behavior in VR, but I like using it on desktop, which means I have to toggle the AFK detection toggle on and off every time I switch between VR and desktop.\n\nThis is unintuitive behavior, and in fact, I'm reading just below my text box a bug reports somebody made claiming their AFK toggle is broken.\n\nThis is a very simple change to make, and I don't see it being controversial.",
